    "media:imagetext": "Flavors of the World\n1:11*\nWherever we fly around the globe, we have the enviable job\nof tasting and savoring the cuisines of the world. We invite\nyou to share our discoveries while traveling with us.\nSalad\nPAl:\nDIAMONDHEAD FRUIT SALAD\nМіж*»#\nA combination of fresh pineapple spears and peach half...\nServed with our honey lime dressing\nDinner Roll\nCreamery Butter\nOThe Sweet Course\nHAUPIA CAKE\nA Hawaiian classic ... Light sponge cake\ntopped with a delicate coconut milk icing\nJasmine Tea\nMilk\nTWA's Freshly Brewed Coffee\nTea\nEntrees\nIE I\nFILET MIGNON TERIYAKI\nCharbroiled blue ribbon beef enhanced\nby our special Oriental glaze... Presented\nwith rice pilaf and parsley whole carrots\nSHRIMP A LA OAHU\nTender shrimp simmered in a Coconut milk sauce\nwith pineapple bits and Macadamia nuts...\nThis island specialty is complemented by\nrice valencia and buttered green beans\nCOQ AU VIN\nBraised chicken prepared in the classic manner\nwith a hearty sauce made from rich stocks, a bouquet\nof herbs, spices, onions and red wine...\nWe serve it with parsley potatoes and buttered green peas\nPlease accept our apologies if your choice\nis not available on today's flight.\nDC-50\n104",
